    "点亮格子的颜色" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Color of the lit cells"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按图纸颜色投影" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Match pattern"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "白色" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "White"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "挑一个颜色" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pick a color"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这个颜色偏暗，投影出的格子可能不易分辨。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This color is fairly dark — the projected cells may be hard to see."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "当前未选中色号，板上不会高亮。请返回上一屏选择一个色号，以查看颜色差异。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No color code is selected yet, so nothing lights up on the board. Go back and pick a color code to see the difference between these options."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按色号原本的颜色投影，黑色、深蓝等较暗的颜色会自动提亮至最高亮度：色相保留，明暗信息丢失，黑色与白色都会显示为白光。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Projects each color code in its own color. Dark ones like black or navy would not light up at all, so they are pushed to full brightness — the hue stays, the lightness is gone: black and white both come out as white light."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无论当前是哪个色号，均投射白光，板上亮度最高、边界最清晰；代价是同时高亮两个色号时无法区分。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Always projects white light, whatever the current color code is. Brightest and crispest on the board; the trade-off is that two color codes lit at once look identical."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "始终投射所选颜色。适合白光刺眼或室内灯光偏黄时更换为更易辨认的颜色，代价同白光模式：无法区分同时高亮的两个色号。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Always projects the color you pick. Useful when white glares on a white board, or when warm room lighting washes it out. Same trade-off as white: two color codes lit at once look identical."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "封面" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cover"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "图纸原图 · 只能看" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pattern (view only)"
          }
        }
