    },
    "用手指划过需要清除的格子。放大后如需平移，请拖动图纸区域。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Swipe across the cells to remove. Zoomed in? Drag the pattern pane to move around."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用手指划过需要清除的格子。放大后如需平移，请先切换回「移动」。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Swipe across the cells to remove. Zoomed in? Switch back to Move to pan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "手指划过要补上的格子。放大后想挪，拖图纸那一块。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Swipe across the cells to fill. Zoomed in? Drag the pattern pane to move around."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "手指划过要补上的格子。放大后想挪，先切回「挪图」。" : {
