    "重新判色" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Read Them Again"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重新识别颜色（核对时修改过的色号将被清除）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Read the colors again (your corrections will be cleared)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将按当前底色和任意色重新识别每一格颜色，核对页中修改过的色号将全部作废，需要重新核对。如需继续之前的核对，请点「取消」，再点上方「回核对颜色」。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every square gets read again using the background and any-color beads you picked. Every color code you corrected while checking is thrown away, and you start checking over. If you only meant to carry on checking, tap Cancel, then tap Back to Checking Colors."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会照现在的底色重看一遍每一格，你在核对页改过的色号全部作废，要重新核对一遍。只是想接着核对的话点「取消」，再点上面那个「回核对颜色」。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every square gets read again using the background color you picked. Every color code you corrected while checking is thrown away, and you start checking over. If you only meant to carry on checking, tap Cancel, then tap Back to Checking Colors."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "修改底色后需要重新识别颜色才能生效，否则返回后仍是原来的识别结果。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A new background color only takes effect after the colors are read again — go straight back and you will see the same colors as before."
          }
        }
      }
    },
