          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The box in the previous step probably missed them. Go back and move it, or drag over a piece right here to add it yourself."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "找到 %lld 个零件。点一下可以选中，选中之后能删除、合并、拆开或者改名。\n有零件没被框住，直接在它上面拖一下就能补一个。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld pieces found. Tap one to select it, then delete, merge, split or rename it.\nIf a piece has no box, just drag over it to add one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无法拆分此零件" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This one can't be split"
