    "关闭投影仪模式" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turn off projector mode"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "四条边的中点各有一个白色 T 形标记，板子正中是一个白色十字。将这些标记对准对应孔位，即可确认中心未偏移。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "There is also a white T at the middle of each edge and a white cross at the center of the board. When those land inside pegs too, the middle is not drifting."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "投影画面四角各有一个直角标记，请将角上的亮块拖到豆板同一角最外侧的孔位——沿板边会有几个孔随之亮起，全部对齐即表示该角已校准。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each corner of the projection shows a right-angle mark. Drag the lit square at its corner onto the outermost peg of that corner of your board — the two arms light up a few more pegs along each edge, and when all of them land on pegs, that corner is aligned."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "投影仪模式" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Projector mode"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "投影仪模式 · 仅高亮当前色号，点击可重新校准" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Projector mode · only the current color lights up. Tap to line up again"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "投影仪无需垂直投射：四角对齐后，App 会自动将画面校正为正方形，中间的格子随之自动对齐。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "An angled projector is fine: once the four corners line up, the app squares the picture back up and every cell in between falls into place."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "投影画面中的方框会按设定格数划分，四角对准板子四角后，每格对应一个孔位。若格数设置有误，偏差会随位置累积增大。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The projected frame is split into this many cells. Once its four corners sit on your board's four corners, one cell covers exactly one peg. Get the count wrong and the middle drifts further off with every cell."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "投屏中 · 需要投射到豆板上？点击开启投影仪模式" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
